      <h2 class="font-bold">About me</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-10 max-w-[700px]">
        <Avatar src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6331999?v=4" alt="Gustavo Herrera" client:load />
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-center md:text-left">
          <p>
            I'm <strong>Gustavo Herrera</strong>, a Senior Fullstack Developer from Venezuela with
